{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-blog-post-js","path":"/js-hangul/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"klloo"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"35f70d0b-3168-534c-a842-a669c11d9546","excerpt":"…","html":"<p>안녕하세요. 굉장히 오랜만에 블로그를 작성하는데요 …</p>\n<p>백만년만에 가지고 온 주제는 자바스크립트로 한글 파싱하기 입니다!</p>\n<p>개인적으로 진행하던 프로젝트에서</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 550px; overflow: hidden!important; border-radius: 8px!important; margin-left: 0!important;\"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/750843c97a959b80b81f94dcefbb0732/0f79a/project.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 10.144927536231883%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAABQAAAACCAYAAABYBvyLAAAACXBIWXMAAAsTAAALEwEAmpwYAAAAaklEQVR42j2KUQ7DIAxDe/97jCahdJAEUHc5LzBpH9Z7ln3M54NmA+odOhStt+gW6X+34UGFdtup1oIe1L0vX/Q5cfg0SGHIlcFSQJLxogTKhMSCUxLK+w4/wZfs39ql/JiYwDl+zLhrxRfRDXm7be/AfwAAAABJRU5ErkJggg=='); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"project.png\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/750843c97a959b80b81f94dcefbb0732/dd45a/project.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/750843c97a959b80b81f94dcefbb0732/948cf/project.png 138w,\n/static/750843c97a959b80b81f94dcefbb0732/6b2ea/project.png 275w,\n/static/750843c97a959b80b81f94dcefbb0732/dd45a/project.png 550w,\n/static/750843c97a959b80b81f94dcefbb0732/0f79a/project.png 689w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 550px) 100vw, 550px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>이렇게 자음 버튼이 있고, 해당 버튼을 누르면 해당 자음으로 시작하는 이름을 가진 사람들만 목록에 보여줘야 하는 기능이 있었습니다. 만약 영어였다면, 그냥 맨 앞글자와 비교만 하면 됐을텐데요. 순간 한글은 어떻게 처리해야하지? 멈칫했습니다.</p>\n<p>하지만 이내 생각을 다잡고… 일단 이름의 맨 앞글자를 초성, 중성, 종성으로 쪼갠다음 초성과 선택한 자음을 비교해서 걸러주면 되겠다…!!! 싶었습니다.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 334px; overflow: hidden!important; border-radius: 8px!important; margin-left: 0!important;\"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/c061247b7885c8e61acd2046017ae616/86d36/hangul.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 96.37681159420289%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"hangul.png\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/c061247b7885c8e61acd2046017ae616/86d36/hangul.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/c061247b7885c8e61acd2046017ae616/948cf/hangul.png 138w,\n/static/c061247b7885c8e61acd2046017ae616/6b2ea/hangul.png 275w,\n/static/c061247b7885c8e61acd2046017ae616/86d36/hangul.png 334w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 334px) 100vw, 334px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>그런데 또 … 한글을 어떻게 쪼개지..?</p>\n<h3 id=\"유니코드\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%9C%A0%EB%8B%88%EC%BD%94%EB%93%9C\" aria-label=\"유니코드 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>유니코드</h3>\n<p>유니코드란 전 세계의 모든 문자를 다룰 수 있는 통일된 문자 집합을 말합니다. 대부분 나라의 문자 및 특수문자, 화살표, 이모티콘 까지 코드로 표현할 수 있습니다.</p>\n<p>당연히 한글 인코딩도 지원하며, 한글에서 조합이 가능한 11,172자를 모두 표현할 수 있습니다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"초성-중성-종성\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%B4%88%EC%84%B1-%EC%A4%91%EC%84%B1-%EC%A2%85%EC%84%B1\" aria-label=\"초성 중성 종성 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>초성, 중성, 종성</h3>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 435px; overflow: hidden!important; border-radius: 8px!important; margin-left: 0!important;\"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/4f6212e87758a65a2e8c250c73320040/330eb/ggdd.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 55.072463768115945%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"ggdd.png\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/4f6212e87758a65a2e8c250c73320040/330eb/ggdd.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/4f6212e87758a65a2e8c250c73320040/948cf/ggdd.png 138w,\n/static/4f6212e87758a65a2e8c250c73320040/6b2ea/ggdd.png 275w,\n/static/4f6212e87758a65a2e8c250c73320040/330eb/ggdd.png 435w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 435px) 100vw, 435px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>한글에는 다음과 같은 초성, 중성, 종성이 존재합니다.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>초성: ㄱ, ㄲ, ㄴ, ㄷ, ㄸ, ㄹ, ㅁ, ㅂ, ㅃ, ㅅ, ㅆ, ㅇ, ㅈ, ㅉ, ㅊ, ㅋ, ㅌ, ㅍ, ㅎ</li>\n<li>중성: ㅏ, ㅐ, ㅑ, ㅒ, ㅓ, ㅔ, ㅕ, ㅖ, ㅗ, ㅘ, ㅙ, ㅚ, ㅛ, ㅜ, ㅝ, ㅞ, ㅟ, ㅠ, ㅡ, ㅢ, ㅣ</li>\n<li>종성: [ ], ㄱ, ㄲ, ㄳ, ㄴ, ㄵ, ㄶ, ㄷ, ㄹ, ㄺ, ㄻ, ㄼ, ㄽ, ㄾ, ㄿ, ㅀ, ㅁ, ㅂ, ㅄ, ㅅ, ㅆ, ㅇ, ㅈ, ㅊ, ㅋ, ㅌ, ㅍ, ㅎ</li>\n</ul>\n<p>초성은 19글자, 중성은 21글자, 종성은 없는 경우를 포함하여 28자 입니다.</p>\n<p>그래서 총 19 x 21 x 28 = 11,172가 표현이 가능한건데요</p>\n<p>하나의 초성으로 만들 수 있는 글자수는 21(중성) x 28(종성) = 588자가 되고, 마찬가지로 하나의 중성은 28자씩 구성될 수 있습니다.</p>\n<p>즉, 초성은 588자, 중성은 28자마다 변경되므로 한글 코드 값은 아래와 같이 계산될 수 있습니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\">한글 유니코드\n<span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0xAC00</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>초성 <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token number\">588</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>중성 <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token number\">28</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> 종성<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0xAC00</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>초성 <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token number\">21</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> 중성<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token number\">28</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> 종성</code></pre></div>\n<p>유니코드에서 한글의 첫글자는 <code class=\"language-text\">0xAC00</code> 부터 시작하기 때문에, 항상 이 값을 더해주는 것이고, 음 뭔가 n진수의 느낌이 납니다. 예를들어 10진수에서 723 이라는 숫자는 <code class=\"language-text\">(7 × 100) + (2 × 10) + 3</code> 으로 나타낼 수 있는 것 처럼요.</p>\n<p>초,중,종성을 각 자리수로 생각해보면 유추하기 쉬울 것 같습니다. <code class=\"language-text\">가</code> 다음은 종성의 자리수가 올라간 <code class=\"language-text\">각</code> , 그 다음은 <code class=\"language-text\">갂</code> , <code class=\"language-text\">갃</code> , <code class=\"language-text\">간</code> … <code class=\"language-text\">갛</code> 까지 간 이후에는, 중성의 자릿수가 올라간 <code class=\"language-text\">개</code> 가 되는 것입니다.</p>\n<p>이 원리와 식을 활용하면 글자에서 초성, 중성, 종성을 분리해낼 수 있습니다!</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> charCode <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">'장'</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span> <span class=\"token number\">0xac00</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> 종성 <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> charCode <span class=\"token operator\">%</span> <span class=\"token number\">28</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> 중성 <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>charCode <span class=\"token operator\">-</span> 종성<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span> <span class=\"token number\">28</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">%</span> <span class=\"token number\">21</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> 초성 <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>charCode <span class=\"token operator\">-</span> 종성<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span> <span class=\"token number\">28</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span> 중성<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span> <span class=\"token number\">21</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\nconsole<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>Cho<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>초성<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> Jung<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>중성<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> Jong<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>종성<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// ㅈ, ㅏ, ㅇ</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>혹은 아래와 같을 수도 있겠네요</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> charCode <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">'장'</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span> <span class=\"token number\">0xac00</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> 초성 <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Math<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">floor</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>charCode <span class=\"token operator\">/</span> <span class=\"token number\">588</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> 중성 <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Math<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">floor</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>charCode <span class=\"token operator\">%</span> <span class=\"token number\">588</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span> <span class=\"token number\">28</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> 종성 <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> charCode <span class=\"token operator\">%</span> <span class=\"token number\">28</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\nconsole<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>Cho<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>초성<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> Jung<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>중성<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> Jong<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>종성<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// ㅈ, ㅏ, ㅇ</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>저는 개인적으로 두번째 식이 더 마음에 듭니다. 10진수 숫자 723에서 각 자리수의 숫자를 뽑아내는 로직과 비슷해서, 조금 더 익숙한 느낌이기 때문입니다. 그러나… 구글링의 결과 99%는 첫번째 식을 사용하더군요… 사실 로직은 두번째 식이 익숙하지만, Math.floor의 연산을 사용하지 않는 첫번째 식이 더 깔끔한 것 같긴 합니다!</p>\n<h3 id=\"코드로-작성해보자\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%BD%94%EB%93%9C%EB%A1%9C-%EC%9E%91%EC%84%B1%ED%95%B4%EB%B3%B4%EC%9E%90\" aria-label=\"코드로 작성해보자 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>코드로 작성해보자</h3>\n<p>그럼 이제 처음에 원했던 기능을 JS 코드로 작성해봅시다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token constant\">CHO_SUNG</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\n <span class=\"token string\">'ㄱ'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n <span class=\"token string\">'ㄲ'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n <span class=\"token string\">'ㄴ'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n <span class=\"token string\">'ㄷ'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n <span class=\"token string\">'ㄸ'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n <span class=\"token string\">'ㄹ'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n <span class=\"token string\">'ㅁ'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n <span class=\"token string\">'ㅂ'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n <span class=\"token string\">'ㅃ'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n <span class=\"token string\">'ㅅ'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n <span class=\"token string\">'ㅆ'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n <span class=\"token string\">'ㅇ'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n <span class=\"token string\">'ㅈ'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n <span class=\"token string\">'ㅉ'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n <span class=\"token string\">'ㅊ'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n <span class=\"token string\">'ㅋ'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n <span class=\"token string\">'ㅌ'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n <span class=\"token string\">'ㅍ'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n <span class=\"token string\">'ㅎ'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>먼저 초성을 정의해줍니다. 제가 원했던 기능은 애초에 초성에 어떤 자음이 있는지만 판단하면 돼서, 초성만 정의해두었습니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token constant\">HANGUL_START_CHARCODE</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">'가'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">charCodeAt</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token constant\">HANGUL_END_CHARCODE</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">'힣'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">charCodeAt</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">isHangul</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\"><span class=\"token literal-property property\">charCode</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> number</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token constant\">HANGUL_START_CHARCODE</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;=</span> charCode <span class=\"token operator\">&amp;&amp;</span> charCode <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;=</span> <span class=\"token constant\">HANGUL_END_CHARCODE</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>그 다음, 한글이 제대로 들어온건지 유효성을 검사하는 함수를 만들었습니다.</p>\n<p>한글의 유니코드는 <code class=\"language-text\">가</code> 부터 시작해서 <code class=\"language-text\">힣</code> 에서 끝납니다. 그래서 첫글자와 끝글자의 코드 값을 저장해두고, 해당 범위의 값인지 판단해줍니다.</p>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">charCodeAt(index)</code> 함수를 사용하면, index에 해당하는 글자의 유니코드 값을 얻어올 수 있습니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token constant\">CHO_PERIOD</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Math<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">floor</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'까'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">charCodeAt</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span> <span class=\"token string\">'가'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">charCodeAt</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">getChosung</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\"><span class=\"token literal-property property\">name</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> string</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> firstLetter <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> name<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> letterCode <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> firstLetter<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">charCodeAt</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token operator\">!</span><span class=\"token function\">isHangul</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>letterCode<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> firstLetter<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> charCode <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> letterCode <span class=\"token operator\">-</span> <span class=\"token constant\">HANGUL_START_CHARCODE</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> index <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Math<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">floor</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>charCode <span class=\"token operator\">/</span> <span class=\"token constant\">CHO_PERIOD</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token constant\">CHO_SUNG</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>index<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>마지막으로 이름을 전달하면 첫글자의 초성을 꺼내주는 함수를 작성했습니다. 먼저 이름의 첫글자를 유니코드로 가져온 후, 위에서 설명했던 식을 사용해서 구현했습니다.</p>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">CHO_PERIOD</code> 값은 한 초성에서 다음 초성으로 넘어가는 데 필요한 문자 코드의 차이를 나타내며 위에서 설명한 하나의 초성으로 구성할 수 있는 모든 글자의 수입니다. <code class=\"language-text\">가</code>는 첫 번째 초성 <code class=\"language-text\">ㄱ</code>으로 시작하는 첫 글자이고, <code class=\"language-text\">까</code>는 두 번째 초성 <code class=\"language-text\">ㄲ</code>으로 시작하는 첫 글자로 두 글자의 유니코드 값을 빼면 588이 나옵니다!</p>\n<h3 id=\"마무리\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EB%A7%88%EB%AC%B4%EB%A6%AC\" aria-label=\"마무리 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>마무리</h3>\n<p>간단하게 이름 첫글자의 초성을 분리해보는 코드를 작성을 해봤는데요!</p>\n<p>여기서 설명한 한글 유니코드의 조합 원리를 활용하면 초성 검색, 특정 단어 뒤에 붙을 조사 결정 등 다양한 기능을 구현해볼 수 있을 것 같습니다!</p>\n<p>저도 이참에 제 블로그에 초성 검색 기능을 추가해볼까~ 싶기도 하네요. 그런 기능이 필요할 만큼 방대한 자료가 있는 건 아니지만 그냥 겉멋용으로요~!</p>","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#%EC%9C%A0%EB%8B%88%EC%BD%94%EB%93%9C\">유니코드</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#%EC%B4%88%EC%84%B1-%EC%A4%91%EC%84%B1-%EC%A2%85%EC%84%B1\">초성, 중성, 종성</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#%EC%BD%94%EB%93%9C%EB%A1%9C-%EC%9E%91%EC%84%B1%ED%95%B4%EB%B3%B4%EC%9E%90\">코드로 작성해보자</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#%EB%A7%88%EB%AC%B4%EB%A6%AC\">마무리</a></li>\n</ul>","frontmatter":{"title":"JS로 한글 파싱하기","date":"August 22, 2024","description":"JS로 한글을 파싱해봤습니다.","category":"프론트엔드","icon":"⚡","tags":["JavaScript","Frontend","Unicode"]}},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/biome/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Biome - 차세대 JS Linter와 Formatter","icon":"⛅"}},"next":null},"pageContext":{"id":"35f70d0b-3168-534c-a842-a669c11d9546","previousPostId":"3f50acc9-024d-54fa-9b23-fe3c104b1db6","nextPostId":null}},"staticQueryHashes":[],"slicesMap":{}}